# DataForSEO partner-API — fase 1: Backlinks Summary (zonder Hub, zonder Consumer PAT)
#
# Compleet backlink-profiel van een domein: aantal backlinks, referring domains,
# spam score, nieuw/verloren links. Live-only endpoint, zelfde vorm als
# domain_rank_overview in partner/domain-overview.http — geen async/task-flow nodig.
# Zie issue #85, kandidaat 1.
#
# Setup: zie docs/requests/.env.example (DATAFORSEO_API_URL, DATAFORSEO_BASIC).
#
# Kosten: $0,024 per request + $0,000036 per rij (max 1000 rijen/request, dus
# max $0,06/call) — bevestigd op https://dataforseo.com/pricing/backlinks/backlinks.
#
# Verwacht bij een nieuw account: status_code 40104 (account nog verifiëren in
# https://app.dataforseo.com/). Dat is géén fout in je .http-bestand.

@apiBase = {{$dotenv DATAFORSEO_API_URL}}
@basic = {{$dotenv DATAFORSEO_BASIC}}
@domain = {{$dotenv DOMAIN}}
###
POST {{apiBase}}/v3/backlinks/summary/live
Authorization: Basic {{basic}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

[
  {
    "target": {{domain}},
    "internal_list_limit": 10,
    "include_subdomains": true,
    "backlinks_status_type": "live"
  }
]
###
POST {{apiBase}}/v3/backlinks/summary/live
Authorization: Basic {{basic}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

[
  {
    "target": {{domain}},
    "internal_list_limit": 10,
    "include_subdomains": true,
    "backlinks_status_type": "all"
  }
]